WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:08.970
All things, even gods and the stars,
move by fate's decree.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:15.070
Plan C, to use a god as a breeding ground,
to summon a yet higher god...

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:20.250
In the end, even it was but a
stepping stool to my great goal.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.000
Augustus and the rest of Anticross,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.540
Cthulhu,

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.310
my mother, Nero,

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.880
and Kuro Daijuji and Al Azif.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.780
All were moved by the gears
of fate, gears that I spun.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:42.720
That is Master Therion's true goal.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.920
To release the one who leads

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:49.630
to the Outer Universe where the
Great Old Ones dwell... Yog-Sothoth.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:56.460
If the door opens here, a swarm of
evil gods will envelop the world!

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.740
The world will end.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.560
All is for the ultimate climax.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.440
Yes.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:08.750
I was born of humanity's mightiest mage,
Nero, and the evil god Yog-Sothoth.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.750
I am the child of a monster.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.500
The priest of a god from beyond time!

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:17.560
Now let us, you and I, finish this...

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:20.220
Here in the rift beyond space and time,

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:24.940
on the other side of nowhere!

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.300
This is the final movement of the symphony,

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.670
God-Slaying Blade.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.820
Damn you...

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.610
Al, we follow Master Therion!

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.340
I want vengeance for Ennea!

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:42.480
Kuro...

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.720
Kuro Daijuji.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.620
I abandon my pact with you.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.530
I abandon my pact with you...

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:13.680
Listen, Kuro Daijuji.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:18.150
You are no longer my master or a mage.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.850
Leave Demonbane!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.590
What?

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.650
What do you mean, Al?

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.710
Are you going to fight alone?

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:29.910
Why?

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.820
Al!

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.010
Yog-Sothoth is connected
to all space and time.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:41.660
Any who pass through that gate must wander

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:47.750
through every universe — past,
present, and future — never to return.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.410
You can do this without me, huh?

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:52.880
Yes, I can.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:57.860
And you'll find a new master, huh?

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:03.330
If I cannot end the battle with
Master Therion, then yes.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.300
Is this goodbye?

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.200
We will never see each other again.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.670
I see...

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.530
So, you're that resolved to it?

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.170
But...

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.130
Why are you crying?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.940
I'm not crying...

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.980
I'm not...

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.020
I'm not crying.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.790
Don't try and hide it.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.420
I'm not!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.190
I exist to spend eternity fighting evil...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.560
Then I'll follow you, as a normal person.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.860
What?!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.230
Once you're through that
gate, human knowledge

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.550
and universal laws, themselves,
no longer apply!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:49.180
I'm the only one who needs to fight.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.740
You don't...

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.880
Don't be so sure of yourself, dummy.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:04:01.330
You don't think I'll keep you safe, do you?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:06.290
You think you're that important?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.950
I'm not full of myself at all!

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:12.790
I know you think you can't leave it to me.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.690
I'm sorry I'm such a useless grimoire.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.770
But even so...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.110
No one could fight just for that.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.380
I don't want to leave you.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:32.280
I've fallen in love with an arrogant,
bratty book named Al.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:38.460
What kind of fool falls in love with a book?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.860
Me.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:45.400
Fool! Fool!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.330
Fool...

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.830
Fool, fool, fool...

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:50.960
Al...

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.300
I've told you how I feel.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.940
So what about you?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.580
I...

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:03.560
I care about you, too, of course!

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:08.290
In a thousand years,
I've never felt so passionately!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:15.420
Not for a master, or a friend in battle,
but for Kuro Daijuji...

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.050
Al, let's go.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.210
Let's go defeat Master Therion.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.710
Kuro...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:38.750
But...

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.020
There are things I'll miss in this world.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.690
<i>Of course there are.</i>

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.680
<i>I want to be here.</i>

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.860
<i>I want to stay here.</i>

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:54.140
<i>But that's because there are things</i>

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.580
<i>in this world that I care for so dearly!</i>

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:03.390
I won't let those stupid monsters hurt them.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.170
Right, Al?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:07.860
That's right.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.980
Then fight, Kuro.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.950
You are not alone.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.870
Yes, that's right!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.120
That's right!

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.500
I'm not alone!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.030
I have Al.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.030
I have Demonbane.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:32.490
We have the power to protect
the things we love!

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:40.400
Mr. Daijuji...

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.880
Al Azif.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.850
Darling, make sure you come back-robo!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.600
You're here, God-Slaying Blade.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.970
Master Therion!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:15.810
The energy of Liber Legis.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.430
The spells cast on its magical engine

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:22.350
maintain Yog-Sothoth's presence in this reality.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.660
If you want to save the world,

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:28.430
you must destroy the Liber Legis!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:32.160
That's been my plan this whole time!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.980
Fallen beast!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.310
Accursed blade that slays evil!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.840
<i>Atlantis...</i>

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.580
<i>Abra...</i>

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.990
<i>Strike!</i>

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:55.820
<i>Kadabra!</i>

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.420
Kuro Daijuji,

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.570
Al Azif...

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:19.290
We have fought this battle
hundreds of millions of times.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.540
All as decreed by fate...

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.950
I, as the prince of the evil god...

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:29.370
You, as the God-Slaying Blade that defeats me.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:34.960
Each time, you have
stood before me in this way.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:38.510
Knowing nothing, innocent.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:41.350
Hate, hate, hate...

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.400
I hate you, Kuro Daijuji!

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:45.250
That nobility!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.980
That purity!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.340
You've taken him from me...

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.270
You've taken my master from me once again.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.740
I hate you!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:09:01.120
No matter how many times
the wheel of fate repeats,

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.220
only you can gain my master's hatred.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.340
Not me.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:11.700
I hate you, Kuro Daijuji!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.500
Master Therion!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.930
Al Azif!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.470
<i>Pnakotic Manuscripts</i>!

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.940
<i>Lemuria...</i>

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.770
<i>Hyperborea...</i>

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:21.810
<i>Impact!</i>

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.110
<i>Zero Drive!</i>

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:32.380
At last... At last, at long last,
the stage is set!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:40.990
Yes, the beginning of the great release.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:45.470
D-Did we get teleported somewhere again?

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:47.500
Where are we?

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.820
Kuro...

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:49.470
Look!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.470
Why?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.610
Why?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.740
<i>The pain is incredible.
It hurts so much, but...</i>

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.580
<i>We long since ran out
of magical energy, but...</i>

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.290
<i>But I can feel the power to fight
coming back to me!</i>

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:14.810
Earth
65 Million Years Earlier

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:12.420
I think I understand.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.260
We haven't been protecting the planet.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.730
The planet's been protecting us!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.130
You can keep going, right, Kuro?

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.350
Of course!

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.880
Kuro Daijuji!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:40.500
Let's finish this, Master Therion!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.680
Until we defeat Master Therion,

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.820
we will be forced to continue this battle...

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.930
Throughout all time, both past and future.

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.900
But do we have the power
to destroy the wheel of fate?

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:58.870
We do... We do!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:02.240
The final and ultimate weapon,

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.010
which can utterly erase the Liber Legis!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.980
Yes, the Shining Trapezohedron!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.470
Yes, that's right.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:13.820
That's right!

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.390
Wh-What's...

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:23.840
It's trying to activate without us again!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.190
The Shining Trapezohedron!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.630
Al, look!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.740
What?!

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:36.110
Did you think it your power alone, Al Azif?

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:38.580
The Shining Trapezohedron!

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:39.900
Yes.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.420
That is correct.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:45.550
Our ultimate magical weapon,
the Shining Trapezohedron.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.670
When the two Shining Trapezohedra
collide, one of us,

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.920
you or I, shall be removed
from the universe completely.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:12:00.360
Kuro Daijuji, the only weapon
which can end our conflict!

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:05.020
The collision of the two
Shining Trapezohedra...

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.000
Simply to bring that about...

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.580
For that sole reason,

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.380
you have been trapped in this
endlessly repeating fate!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.910
The pinnacle of human life.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:16.870
The hero who knows not despair.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.840
The ultimate in human evil.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.360
The man-devil who knows despair.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:25.110
Those were the two pawns I required.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:29.360
Yes. All is I, Nyarlathotep, will!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.830
<i>Here at the end of the gods' first sin,</i>

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.130
<i>carved into a raging spiral!</i>

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.230
<i>Here at the end of the
path where a saint fell,</i>

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.500
<i>blood-stained and worn away!</i>

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.790
<i>We fulfill our covenant!</i>

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.110
<i>With a dark and abiding
hatred in our hearts...</i>

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.380
<i>With a dear cry for life in our hearts...</i>

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.500
<i>We swear upon a funeral wreath...</i>

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.550
<i>We swear upon a wreath of celebration...</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:59.100
<i>That we are the ones
who create the world!</i>

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.930
Don't do it, Kuro!

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.230
This is all an evil god's plot!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:20.110
Now the universe will return
to its rightful state!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:26.770
Our universe, sealed away by the
Shining Trapezohedra, will return!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:30.120
The Garden of Azathoth will be released!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.160
What?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.170
What's happening?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.850
I don't recognize this!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.850
I don't recognize this ending!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.380
<i>He absorbed the energy
of the Trapezohedra...</i>

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.900
<i>That should be impossible...</i>

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.400
<i>No human could do that.</i>

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.930
I can do it because I'm human.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.530
Kuro...

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:21.970
I see... So it was all your doing, Nya?

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:26.710
No... Evil god, Nyarlathotep!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:30.440
Kuro Daijuji, that power...

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:32.320
You can't be...

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.300
In that darkness,

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.490
I was being eaten away...

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:43.530
Life was being stripped away, meaninglessly...

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.130
I thought that this was how
the world would end.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:51.170
But life wasn't silent before its end.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.440
Even as its helplessness devoured it,

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:56.510
there was an endless feeling welling up in it!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.810
Rage and hatred!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.850
A fierce cry of life, reaching toward hope,

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:07.020
even as it wept tears and wept blood!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:13.290
A cry of the soul that can only
be heard and made by humans!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:18.960
Don't screw with humanity, god!

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:25.340
Kuro Daijuji!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:27.870
Kuro...

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.530
Al, stay with me.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.940
With you, I can do anything.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:38.050
Of course, my love.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.860
<i>Out of the sky of prayer,</i>

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:48.220
<i>with a fervent cry in its heart...</i>

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.530
<i>We open the path to tomorrow!</i>

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:56.900
A pentagram...

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.640
Elder sign!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:04.060
<i>Innocent Wings, Demonbane!</i>

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:16.270
Impossible... Was I, too, caught
in fate's vast wheel?

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.570
I won't let you...

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.660
I won't let you destroy my master!

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:26.830
It's enough.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.130
Well done and thank you, Etheldreda.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:31.800
Master...

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.770
This, also, is an ending I sought...

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.820
Release from the bonds of eternity.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.110
Master...

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:56.370
<i>I never realized the stars
were so beautiful...</i>

00:16:57.230 --> 00:17:01.160
<i>Even if I'm alone here,
beneath their sparkle.</i>

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.370
<i>No.</i>

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.030
<i>You are not alone.</i>

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:08.280
<i>Etheldreda... You came, as well?</i>

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:10.240
<i>Yes, master.</i>

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:14.340
<i>I would never leave you alone.</i>

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.200
<i>That's right...</i>

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.150
<i>It's a bit too cold to be here alone.</i>

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.090
<i>Will you stay with me?</i>

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:21.650
<i>Yes.</i>

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:26.620
Let's stay here and watch the world forever.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:32.120
Let's spend eternity destroying
nothing, hurting nothing.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:36.630
Simply laughing at life and
its struggles, admiring it...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.130
Doing that and nothing else.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:43.620
Yes, that and nothing else is the
salvation we've been allowed.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.610
Etheldreda.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.800
Yes, master.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.460
It's over.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.070
Kuro...

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:02.550
It's okay.

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:06.630
Even if we spend eternity here, you're here.

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.460
You're here for me.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.100
Kuro.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.200
It was pretty rough this time.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:17.060
I'm gonna take a short nap.

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:20.110
If you're tired, you sleep, too.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.580
We've got all the time in the damned world.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.050
Yeah... After I watch you fall asleep.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:28.520
What's fun about that?

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.860
It will be the first moment
of peace I've ever known.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.770
Then watch all you want.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.330
Good night.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:48.690
<i>What peace...</i>

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:51.020
<i>What happiness.</i>

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.280
Well done.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:59.480
But will you do one more
thing for me, Demonbane?

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:08.060
Wh-What...

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.530
Al!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:14.310
If I send only you, I can
return you to Arkham City.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:19.030
Your smile looks best beneath the sun.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.510
So live as a human.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.470
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:25.920
Thank you,

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.300
my kind master.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:33.180
And farewell, the one man I'll ever love...

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:36.420
You idiot! How can you just decide that?

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.390
We said we'd be together forever!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:39.860
Al!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.860
Al! Al!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.800
Al!

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:56.840
Let's go, Demonbane...

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:07.830
This place is a bit cold to be here alone...

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.760
My, Kuro!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.600
You're the same as ever!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.480
Work, work!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:41.350
I-I get it... Get me some food.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.410
Kuro's such a loser!

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:46.510
Loser!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.230
Are you okay, Mr. Kuro?

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:56.840
You are the ultimate machine!

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.950
What's wrong?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.640
I thought I saw a face I remembered...

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.770
You idiot...

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.360
You idiot!

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.150
You idiot!

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.020
I'll never forgive you.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.810
I'll never, ever...

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:48.380
Al...

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:53.320
I don't think you need to get that mad.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.070
We made a pact, right?

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:03.070
You can't get away now, Kuro Daijuji.

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:04.470
Al!

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:06.200
Kuro!

00:22:18.130 --> 00:22:20.110
It's a little present,

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:21.580
from god.

00:22:21.580 --> 00:22:24.090
Now go, Kuro Daijuji!

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:26.320
Go, Al Azif...

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:30.240
Release the arrow of fate!

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:36.090
That's...
